Read machines and mechanical design from zero (@mech-reading: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @mechanical-engineering, #source "../sources/Engineering-Statics-Baker-and-Haynes.lingua#r_3DXGKGQSPPA9YDNH2WSB8XRN80", #source "../sources/FUNdaMENTALS-of-Design-Slocum.lingua#r_58Q6VQJ3FXXGXRBJ3DK0AVC3WQ", #source "../sources/Mechanics-of-Materials-Roylance.lingua#r_7K2RYA9504FGFGJTVWHMWXD5WY", #source "../sources/Elements-of-Mechanical-Design-MIT-2-72.lingua#r_31S9Z88TMF2875BF5KA5825GX7", #mechanical-engineering "A-machine-begins-with-a-useful-function.lingua#r_6JY8HRXMA2FQZ1EGBG7KE458SG") { r_61PQRJWBQXW4MHY2TC3H7HH4WG
**Read:** Begin [Engineering Statics — Baker and Haynes](../sources/Engineering-Statics-Baker-and-Haynes.lingua#r_3DXGKGQSPPA9YDNH2WSB8XRN80), chapter 1, and [FUNdaMENTALS of Design — Alexander Slocum](../sources/FUNdaMENTALS-of-Design-Slocum.lingua#r_58Q6VQJ3FXXGXRBJ3DK0AVC3WQ), topics 1–3. Work the complete ten-chapter statics book through the following Records. Read and solve problems, then return to the machine whose behavior you want to understand.

Start with a door latch, bicycle, hand drill, pump or other familiar mechanism. Describe its purpose and observe what changes when it works. Name the parts you can identify, the contacts between them, where the effort comes from and what useful result is produced. An observation, a drawing and an explanation are different steps.

No prior engineering course is assumed at this entrance. Shared quantity, geometry and vector Records supply the mathematics when it first becomes necessary. As mechanics deepens, derive equations, compare models and test them against observations instead of treating a catalogue value as an explanation.

Later reading develops through all of [Modules in Mechanics of Materials — David Roylance](../sources/Mechanics-of-Materials-Roylance.lingua#r_7K2RYA9504FGFGJTVWHMWXD5WY), [FUNdaMENTALS of Design — Alexander Slocum](../sources/FUNdaMENTALS-of-Design-Slocum.lingua#r_58Q6VQJ3FXXGXRBJ3DK0AVC3WQ), the available [Elements of Mechanical Design — MIT 2.72, Spring 2009](../sources/Elements-of-Mechanical-Design-MIT-2-72.lingua#r_31S9Z88TMF2875BF5KA5825GX7) sequence and increasingly specific primary methods. Design, fabrication, observation, maintenance and research provide different kinds of evidence. The available material develops statics and dynamics through coupled motion, vibration, rotating machinery and advanced analytical studies. Material and structural studies continue through strength, fracture, fatigue, time-dependent response, experiments and numerical verification. Machine-element studies then join motion, transmission, contact, joints and actuators in three substantial investigations. Manufacture, measurement, continuing service, an integrated machine case and independent research follow through the connected Records.

**Return:** [Mechanical engineering and machine design](../Mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design.lingua#r_0017YZ63HZBZ4P4WD8DECVWE4R).
**Continue:** [A machine begins with a useful function](A-machine-begins-with-a-useful-function.lingua#r_6JY8HRXMA2FQZ1EGBG7KE458SG).

